    "resourceSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 145\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"500\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#090d16\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"20\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-weight=\"bold\">CSS ENGINE & HYDRATION FOOTPRINT</text>\n  \n  <!-- Row 1: Label (Col 1), Bars (Col 2), Values (Col 3) -->\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"48\" font-family=\"'Outfit', sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\">CSS BUNDLE WEIGHT</text>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"39\" width=\"115\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">320 KB (v3 + PostCSS)</text>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"51\" width=\"11\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#10b981\" />\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\">18 KB (Rust Engine v4)</text>\n\n  <!-- Divider -->\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n\n  <!-- Row 2: Label (Col 1), Bars (Col 2), Values (Col 3) -->\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"88\" font-family=\"'Outfit', sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\">CLIENT HYDRATION</text>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"79\" width=\"101\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"86\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">145ms (Legacy React)</text>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"91\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" />\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"98\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-weight=\"bold\">8ms (React 19 Concurrent)</text>\n\n  <!-- Legend: Centered -->\n  <rect x=\"150\" y=\"122\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n  <text x=\"164\" y=\"129\" font-family=\"'Outfit', sans-serif\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">Baseline Architecture</text>\n  <rect x=\"300\" y=\"122\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#10b981\" />\n  <text x=\"314\" y=\"129\" font-family=\"'Outfit', sans-serif\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#10b981\">Optimized Production</text>\n</svg>",
    "resourceDesc": "By compiling styles through Tailwind CSS v4 natve Rust engine and structuring the client under React 19, the production CSS footprint was compressed from 320KB to 18KB, and UI initialization delay was reduced to only 8ms.",
    "roi": [
      "Secure Clinical Data isolation: Row Level Security (RLS) on Supabase PostgreSQL prevents any leaks of personal health or biophysical markers (steps, calories, HRV).",
      "94% reduction in style payloads: Native Tailwind CSS v4 Rust compiler generates ultra-light 18KB stylesheets, boosting mobile loading speeds.",
      "High-speed real-time updates: Integrated Supabase Realtime syncs messages and physical routine tracking logs immediately, ensuring zero-latency updates between athletes and coaches."
    ],
