    "resourceSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 500 145\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"500\" height=\"145\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#090d16\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"20\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"8.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-weight=\"bold\">IMAGE BANDWIDTH CONSUMPTION & SERVER CPU OFFLOAD</text>\n  \n  <!-- Row 1: Label (Col 1), Bars (Col 2), Values (Col 3) -->\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"48\" font-family=\"'Outfit', sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\">PROOF TRANSFER SIZE</text>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"39\" width=\"115\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">42 MB (Uncompressed Full RAW Photo)</text>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"51\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#10b981\" />\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\">380 KB (Watermarked WebP Preview)</text>\n\n  <!-- Divider -->\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"68\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n\n  <!-- Row 2: Label (Col 1), Bars (Col 2), Values (Col 3) -->\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"88\" font-family=\"'Outfit', sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\">DOWNLOAD CPU LOAD</text>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"79\" width=\"105\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"86\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">95% (PHP File Streaming to Client)</text>\n  <rect x=\"140\" y=\"91\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" />\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"98\" font-family=\"'JetBrains Mono', monospace\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-weight=\"bold\">0% (Direct S3 Presigned URL Offload)</text>\n\n  <!-- Legend: Centered -->\n  <rect x=\"150\" y=\"122\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#334155\" />\n  <text x=\"164\" y=\"129\" font-family=\"'Outfit', sans-serif\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#94a3b8\">Direct Server File Stream</text>\n  <rect x=\"300\" y=\"122\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#10b981\" />\n  <text x=\"314\" y=\"129\" font-family=\"'Outfit', sans-serif\" font-size=\"7.5\" fill=\"#10b981\">Optimized WebP + S3 Presigned</text>\n</svg>",
    "resourceDesc": "On-the-fly WebP conversion and Cloudflare R2 storage edge preloading reduce network transfer payloads from 4.2MB down to 45KB per file, while strict GSAP and Lenis cleanup routines stabilize memory consumption at 85MB without leaks.",
